{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[F/A]So [Gm]now I proclaim liberty for [Eb]you declares the Lord
[Bb]Liberty to the sword and to the [F]plague and famine
I [Gm7]will make you a horror to all the [Eb]kingdoms of the earth
[Bb]Handing you over to [F]those who seek your lives
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Zedeki[Bb]ah and his officials will face their [Eb]enemies
[Gm7]The army of Ba[F/A]bylon that has with[Bb]drawn from you
[F/A]They will [Gm7]fight against this [F]city and capture [Eb]it
